<title>UK: U. Utilities yr profits hit by exceptionals.</title>
<headline>U. Utilities yr profits hit by exceptionals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)(adjusted)  77.2		   vs 73.4</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 37.2		   vs 32.66</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excepts    444		    vs 389.2</p>
<p> Pretax, post-excepts   283.9		  vs 272.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,377.2		vs 1,838.6</p>
<p>NOTE - United Utilities made an exceptional charge of 83 million stg in respect of operations in Bangkok and a loss on disposal of businesses of 77.1 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits before exceptionals in a range between 458 and 475 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - United Utilities Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
